<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/msa@/~cl_16__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "b" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/msa@> .
