<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/msa@/~cl_17> <https://schema.org/text> "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memotong seksyen 16d. Pindaan seksyen 19"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/msa@> .
