<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/msa@/~cl_26__para_o__subpara_ii__subpara_B> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “Timbalan Naib Canselor” perkataan “yang bertanggungjawab bagi hal ehwal akademik”;"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/msa@/~cl_26__para_p> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/msa@/~cl_26> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/msa@> .
